# IMPORTANT: This value is committed to git, so Cloudflare Pages will use it
# as a fallback UNLESS you override it with a Pages environment variable of
# the same name (Pages Dashboard > your project > Settings > Environment
# variables > VITE_API_BASE_URL). The dashboard variable always wins over
# this file during a Pages build.
#
# Set this to your actual deployed Worker URL -- copy it from
# `npx wrangler deploy` output, or Cloudflare dashboard > Workers & Pages >
# icebrim-api > "Visit" URL. It must NOT have a trailing slash.
#
# If this points at the wrong Worker (or a placeholder), every API call
# from the live site -- login, products, blog, gallery, media uploads --
# will fail or silently show nothing.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://icebrim-api.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev
